   "y": 1602.0,
   "width": 299.00000000000006,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "1. アプリ側の直引きが残っている(右端)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. アプリ側の直引きが残っている(右端)",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12221,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 54071,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1744",
   "x": 2696.5999999999995,
   "y": 1622.0,
   "width": 624.2000000000007,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    Sequence 群 → SceneManager / GameManager、ScoreSystem → GameManager、\n    CameraStartSystem → OptionManager。\n    SystemContext / ObjectContext に経路があるので、そちらへ寄せる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    Sequence 群 → SceneManager / GameManager、ScoreSystem → GameManager、\n    CameraStartSystem → OptionManager。\n    SystemContext / ObjectContext に経路があるので、そちらへ寄せる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12228,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 54102,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1745",
   "x": 2696.5999999999995,
   "y": 1702.0,
   "width": 513.0000000000002,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. コンポーネントのヘルパーがヘッダーで Instance() を呼んでいる",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. コンポーネントのヘルパーがヘッダーで Instance() を呼んでいる",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12235,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 54133,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1746",
   "x": 2696.5999999999995,
   "y": 1722.0,
   "width": 648.8000000000008,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    ModelComponent / ParticlesComponent は解消。\n    SoundComponent / HitSoundComponent → AudioManager、\n    FollowTargetComponent / AttachmentSlotsComponent → SceneManager が残り。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    ModelComponent / ParticlesComponent は解消。\n    SoundComponent / HitSoundComponent → AudioManager、\n    FollowTargetComponent / AttachmentSlotsComponent → SceneManager が残り。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12242,
